+	/**
+	 * Retrieve in Pages the <code>Vet</code>s holding the named specialty. The whole name
+	 * must match, disregarding letter case; case is normalized in the query so the match
+	 * behaves the same on every supported database vendor.
+	 * <p>
+	 * Deliberately uncached: the key would be caller-supplied text, and the
+	 * <code>vets</code> cache bounds neither its size nor its entries' lifetime.
